WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:02.950
Iroha.

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:07.320
How are things going with you
and your ugly four-eyed friend?

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:09.780
I don't care if we are family. You're making me mad.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:14.700
They're going well. Don't you worry.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:18.650
And you still go on all your dates to the school
and the park and that kind of thing?

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:20.200
We do not.

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:21.860
The other day...

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:23.990
"The other day"?

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:27.950
I visited Tsutsun's family. We had oden for dinner.

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:28.700
Huh?

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:31.490
What are you, in fourth grade?

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:34.530
Why are you blushing over something
like oden? Are you stupid?

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:35.900
Why do you even care?

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:41.280
Because... I don't like the fact that my sister
is still going out with that geeky loser.

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:43.450
What do you know about Tsutsun, Chika?

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:44.360
Plenty.

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:47.700
I know that he's been making you
look more like a geeky loser.

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:51.570
You never used to wear sweats around the house.

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:54.070
W-well, I...

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:55.860
Put on some sweats,
for crying out loud!!

00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:55.740
Put on some sweats, for crying out loud!

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:58.650
A real man makes a woman beautiful.

00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:01.530
He is definitely dragging you down to his level.

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:04.320
Why should I have to listen to your insults
just because I'm wearing sweats?

00:01:04.490 --> 00:01:07.070
Anyway, I don't know if he's asexual or what,

00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:10.530
but if he's satisfied with your relationship
being what it is, he's doomed as a male.

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:16.150
With a wet towel?!

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:38.740
Konna tokoro de naitetatte

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:44.740
Daremo kizuki ya shinai wakatterunda

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:48.450
Nanmo nakatta ka no you ni

00:01:48.530 --> 00:01:54.150
Kako o keshisatte sekai dake susunde yuku

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:58.990
Kimi o utsusu to kimeta film nanoni

00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:03.490
Tamatte yuku soko nashi no sora

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:05.530
Wasuretatte kiechainai

00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:08.240
Ano itami wa hora, nan dattakke?

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:13.900
Kawaru keshiki mayotte shimatta nara

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:18.030
Ano uta o omoidashite miyou ka

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:23.610
Sou ne, kanashii koto mo futari nara

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:27.400
Takaramono ni natte yuku hazu sa

00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:36.530
Nijinde mo kienakatta

00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:41.900
Ano hi no kimi o misetai

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:56.110
Episode 19
Regarding the Troubling
Invitation from My Girlfriend.

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:56.150
Ito! Good mor-

00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:57.280
Takanashi!

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:00.740
I wanted to talk to you about something.
Do you have time?

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:02.530
Sure.

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:04.610
But can it wait until after school?

00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:05.570
Yeah.

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:07.860
Ito and Takanashi.

00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:09.700
You don't see them together every day.

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:11.360
See you later!

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:12.820
Let's go to the arcade!

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:13.900
Ito!

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:16.030
Ts-Tsutsui.

00:03:16.030 --> 00:03:19.860
Sorry, I'm in a hurry. Ayado is waiting for me.

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:21.240
See you tomorrow!

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:30.200
What's wrong, Tsutsun?

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:31.150
Nothing.

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:37.740
Wait, so...

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:41.150
So Ito lied to me?

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:46.900
What would he want to talk to Takanashi about
so badly that he would have to lie to me?

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:49.240
What is this I'm feeling?

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:51.650
I think I might cry.

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:54.400
Hey. Tsutsun, are you okay?

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:56.400
Earth to Tsutsun!

00:03:57.150 --> 00:03:58.820
S-sorry, what did you say?

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:00.950
We were talking about our next three-day weekend!

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:02.200
Oh yeah, we were.

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:07.030
Last time, things were so crazy at home,
we could only go to the park.

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:08.990
What do you want to do this time?

00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:12.820
Well...

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:14.860
Hmm. I'll think about it.

00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:15.740
Okay.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:26.320
He's obviously worried about something.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:27.860
What's wrong, Ito?

00:04:28.570 --> 00:04:32.570
It's something he can't say to me.
Something he can't say to me...

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:34.950
Is it me?!

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:37.240
Huh?

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:39.070
Now YOU'RE bugging me?

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:40.400
Just come with me.

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:44.780
So? What do you want?

00:04:44.780 --> 00:04:46.780
Well... um...

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:49.570
What? If you don't get on with it, I'm leaving.

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:53.450
What was it Ito wanted to talk to you about?

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:55.030
Huh?

00:04:55.240 --> 00:04:56.740
What is this?

00:04:57.070 --> 00:04:58.900
Please don't tell me you're jealous.

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:00.320
Gross. You're not a girl.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:01.320
I'm not jealous!

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:04.610
I'm afraid maybe I did something to him again!

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:08.320
What? No. You think everything's about you?

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:11.650
Uh, oh. Well, that's good then.

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:14.780
Come on, you guys are best friends, aren't you?

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:18.360
If you did something wrong,
he'd tell you to your face, right?

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:20.610
Th-that's a good point.

00:05:20.610 --> 00:05:21.950
Then what did he want with you?

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:25.360
Hey, even I wouldn't go around
blabbing people's secrets.

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:27.610
O-oh. Right.

00:05:27.820 --> 00:05:29.700
So what could it have been?

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:32.360
This concern you would have been useless in solving.

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:36.200
Do you always have to make it
as insulting as you possibly can?

00:05:36.740 --> 00:05:37.820
What could it be?

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:41.780
Something I can't help with... but Takanashi can...

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:44.900
Well, you would be useless with this one.

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:47.490
You haven't done it yet.

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:48.780
"Done it"?

00:05:49.610 --> 00:05:51.820
Takanashi... and me.

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:54.570
One thing he has way more of than me... manliness?

00:05:54.860 --> 00:05:58.820
Which means it would be girl troubles
that he can't tell me about.

00:05:58.820 --> 00:06:00.990
And something I haven't done yet...

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:03.110
No! It can't be!

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:05.030
Is this about sex?

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:07.360
You're finally starting to think like a real person.

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:10.530
Wait a minute! How are you so sure I haven't done it yet?!

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:12.450
Anyone can see it.

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:15.950
There is not a single iota of sexuality in your entire body.

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:17.450
"S-sexuality"?

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:20.320
Ito is beating you.

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:21.700
Wha-?

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:23.490
Whaaaat?!

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:25.320
Itooooo!

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:30.030
Takanashi's really going to be a tough nut to crack.

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:33.400
That last date was pretty much the least sexy thing ever.

00:06:33.610 --> 00:06:35.780
Excuse me! God!

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:39.320
It's about time you made me happy, too!

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:41.240
Ariel!

00:06:41.450 --> 00:06:44.110
Hm? Uh, what? Who are you?

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:47.150
You remember! I was with Micchan at the school festival!

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:49.400
Oh, I do remember!

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:52.530
You're the only one who finished
your strawberry parfait with added mustard!

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:55.280
It wasn't easy, either!

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:57.110
There was so much mustard in there!

00:06:57.360 --> 00:06:59.490
So, Ariel, what's your real name?

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:01.570
Arisa Ishino.

00:07:01.780 --> 00:07:03.200
Okay, Arisa.

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:06.530
Ever since the school festival,
I've been thinking about how cute you are.

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:08.450
You... think I'm cute?

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:10.490
Let's hang out sometime!

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:12.900
N-no, no, no!

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:16.860
That was close. But even I can learn from my mistakes.

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:20.570
Oh, how many times playboys like you
have taken the best times of my life,

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:22.490
then plunged me into the depths of despair.

00:07:22.820 --> 00:07:25.740
Wow, harsh. Do I look like that kind of guy?

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:27.070
Yes, you do.

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:33.570
Back at the maid cafe, Micchan said the other girls
were better, but I thought you were the cutest maid there.

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:34.700
Really?

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:36.700
So let's be friends.

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:38.400
You wouldn't mind being friends, would you?

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:43.900
Micchan!

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:45.400
Going home already?

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:46.240
Yeah.

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:47.360
Guess what!

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:49.110
Ariel just agreed to be my friend!

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:51.320
What? Who's Ariel?

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:54.200
You know, the maid at the school festival.

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:56.030
Oh, you mean Ishino.

00:07:56.650 --> 00:08:00.110
You're just friends with her, right, Micchan?
There's nothing between you, right?

00:08:00.610 --> 00:08:01.530
Right. So?

00:08:01.530 --> 00:08:03.780
So you won't mind if I get close?

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:08.200
Eh? This is Ishino. Are you serious?

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:12.900
She reminds me of my first love.
My teacher from preschool.

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:14.610
I see.

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:17.820
Well, why not? She's always wanted a boyfriend.

00:08:17.820 --> 00:08:18.820
Really?

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:19.820
Alright!

00:08:26.990 --> 00:08:28.070
Ito...

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:30.780
Ito, my friend, have you already gone to the other side?!

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:35.700
And yet you won't tell me about it. You're making me sad!

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:38.110
I get it.

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:41.990
It's to spare my feelings,
since I have a girlfriend but I haven't done it yet.

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:46.740
I'm such a useless friend. I'm sorry, Ito.

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:49.990
Tsutsui!

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:52.450
Do you want to go to the new bookstore
that just opened over-

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:54.780
Uh, s-sorry! I have stuff to do!

00:08:55.490 --> 00:08:56.990
Uh, okay.

00:08:57.530 --> 00:08:58.400
I can't do it!

00:08:58.400 --> 00:09:00.820
I'm too desperate to ask Ito about his secret.

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:04.320
And I feel so rejected. I just can't act normal around him!

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:05.700
Tsutsui.

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:07.820
Sorry, I'm walking home with her today.

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:09.700
Tsutsui.

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:12.360
Oops, I forgot something! Sorry, go on without me!

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:14.240
Tsutsu-

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:15.860
Sorry, I'm going to a funeral!

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.320
Tsutsui.

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:23.780
Yeah. Sorry.

00:09:25.320 --> 00:09:26.740
I'm sorry.

00:09:26.740 --> 00:09:30.030
I was just so curious about
why you were talking to Takanashi.

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:32.200
So I asked him.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:35.400
I didn't realize you'd already crossed over into adulthood.

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:36.450
What?!

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:37.820
C-congratulations.

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:40.110
N-no! I haven't yet!

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:43.280
I talked to him because...

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:45.110
Actually...

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:48.360
I'll be going to Ayado's house next week.

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:54.780
And I kinda think, when we're alone together,
things might start to move very quickly into that territory.

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:57.700
So I went to Takanashi to get some pointers.

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:00.150
I'm sorry.

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:04.110
I'm still kind of embarrassed
to talk about this kind of thing with you.

00:10:05.650 --> 00:10:08.610
That's okay! W-w-w-w-w-we don't
have any experience with that!

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:11.700
Yeah! I wouldn't be able to help you with that anyway!

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:13.570
Uh, I guess that's true.

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:17.900
So even brand new couples can take it that far that fast.

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:19.950
What is wrong with me?

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:22.740
Nothing! Everyone goes at their own pace!

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:29.900
With me and Ayado, I think we're using that kind of thing
to fill the voids in each other's hearts.

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:32.650
Our hearts have been thirsty for so long,

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:36.200
now we want each other so badly,
we can't stop anymore.

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:38.700
I see.

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:42.860
And here I was thinking,
"Wow, I guess Ito does have a typical male sex drive."

00:10:43.110 --> 00:10:44.900
I'm sorry for judging you.

00:10:45.780 --> 00:10:47.990
That wasn't it at all.

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:51.400
It was just the natural thing for the two of them.

00:10:52.570 --> 00:10:56.200
I really am sorry that I was prying like that.

00:10:56.200 --> 00:11:00.360
It's okay. Takanashi's advice was pretty vague, too.

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:03.990
Don't worry. Your instincts will tell you what to do.

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:08.780
In retrospect, I should have gone to you first, anyway.

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:10.820
No, seriously, I would not have helped.

00:11:11.030 --> 00:11:14.400
She and I... aren't ever going to do those things.

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:18.650
That's okay. If that's what you've decided.

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:28.110
What's up, Tsutsun? You're lost in thought again.

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:30.530
Oh, it's just...

00:11:30.530 --> 00:11:33.610
I spent all that time in my own head, worrying about Ito.

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:36.150
And I'm realizing how stupid that was.

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:39.320
Ito and I are both changing as people.

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:42.450
And we're going to keep changing. We're not done.

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:50.650
I wonder how long I'll be around to see how you change.

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:51.650
Huh?

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:53.400
Hey!

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:55.570
I know what we should do over the long weekend!

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:57.860
S-sure, whatever you want.

00:11:58.110 --> 00:12:00.610
I heard you! You promised!

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:01.820
Uh, yeah.

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:03.860
I want to go on a trip!

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:06.950
A day trip? Like picking strawberries?

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:09.150
No, I want an overnight trip.

00:12:09.150 --> 00:12:11.900
I-I thought I told you we can't do that!

00:12:11.900 --> 00:12:13.150
N-not a sleepover!

00:12:13.740 --> 00:12:17.700
You said whatever I want.
Just a minute ago, you promised.

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:19.400
So it's settled.

00:12:20.110 --> 00:12:20.990
What?

00:12:25.650 --> 00:12:28.030
How is this happening?

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:32.530
I just told Ito that we would never do that kind of thing.

00:12:32.530 --> 00:12:34.950
Going on a trip means... A trip means...

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:37.650
We actually WILL do it?

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:39.570
What am I gonna do?

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:44.400
I think I'm starting to see why Ito
was desperate enough to talk to Takanashi!

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:50.950
Well?

00:12:51.150 --> 00:12:52.360
"Well?" What?

00:12:52.360 --> 00:12:56.150
I told you, I'm here to properly
introduce myself as Anzu's boyfriend.

00:12:57.820 --> 00:13:01.200
And right from the start, you hit me
with your aura of intimidation. It's not nice.

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:03.700
Wow. You're an annoying brat.

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:06.740
As if you weren't irritating enough
just being Tsutsui's brother.

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:10.490
I can't choose my brother. Your anger is unreasonable.

00:13:10.610 --> 00:13:14.450
You're a grown-up. Can't you try
to talk to me like a rational adult?

00:13:14.070 --> 00:13:14.400
Grr!

00:13:14.740 --> 00:13:17.400
We're done here. I refuse to allow this! Go home!

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:19.740
And there it is, the hot temper.

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:21.490
You little-!

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:27.990
I apologize for keeping her out late the other day.

00:13:28.610 --> 00:13:30.490
I'm sorry for making you worry.

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:34.490
But I love Anzu.

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:38.110
She always listens to me with a smile on her face.

00:13:38.110 --> 00:13:41.240
She's always so nice,
and I've always thought she was pretty.

00:13:43.950 --> 00:13:47.990
But then I found out that she doesn't have a father.

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:52.280
And I figured she's probably had a lot of struggles.

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:56.780
But she still always came to me
with that big, bright smile of hers.

00:13:57.200 --> 00:13:59.780
And that thought hits me right in the heart.

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:02.030
It made me love her even more.

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:06.780
And it made realize that I want to help you keep her safe.

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:09.030
Kaoru...

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:13.740
Look. This better not be
some calculated speech of yours.

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:14.610
Huh?

00:14:21.150 --> 00:14:22.070
Takanashi!

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:25.320
Uh... I was hoping to talk to you!

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:27.990
Really? That's great. I wanted to talk to you, too.

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:28.950
What?

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:37.450
Wait a minute! Why did you just hit me?!

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:40.200
Because I can't hit a grade-school kid.

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:41.740
What?!

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:45.360
But I wanted to talk! And all I get is a punch in the face?!

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:49.780
Ishino! Are you free to-

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:51.650
Arisa! Good morning!

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:54.490
So you wanna go somewhere after school today?

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:56.490
What? I don't know.

00:14:56.490 --> 00:15:00.030
Oh yeah! The pancake place
by the station is crazy good!

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:02.990
Wow. You know a lot about sweets for a guy.

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:04.360
Definitely a playboy.

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:05.650
I am not.

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:07.530
I actually just like desserts.

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:09.780
Hey, Micchan!

00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:13.070
You remember when we went to that pancake place?

00:15:13.400 --> 00:15:15.650
I was thinking of taking Arisa there today.

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:17.360
I don't care.

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:22.990
Wow, that was scary.

00:15:22.990 --> 00:15:25.490
I haven't seen Micchan that grumpy in ages!

00:15:25.490 --> 00:15:26.610
I wonder what happened.

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:28.650
Beats me.

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:40.570
What's wrong, Ishino?

00:15:42.070 --> 00:15:43.280
Nothing.

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:46.110
Tell me something entertaining, Tsutsui.

00:15:46.110 --> 00:15:47.780
Don't be so demanding...

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:50.610
Okay, can I ask you for some advice, then?

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:52.070
What?

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:55.360
It's looking like I'm going to go on a trip with her.

00:15:55.360 --> 00:15:56.530
What is this?!

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:58.820
You DO have something entertaining to tell me!

00:15:58.820 --> 00:16:00.240
It is not entertaining!

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:02.700
Why are you so excited to talk about other people?!

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:05.490
She asked me to go on a trip.

00:16:05.990 --> 00:16:07.650
But I don't want to go.

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:09.110
What?! Why not?!

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:12.030
It's an overnight... you know I can't do that!

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:13.030
Why not?!

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:16.570
I don't want things to be like that between us.

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:18.740
Why?

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:20.240
I don't know.

00:16:20.610 --> 00:16:21.990
Why don't I?

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:26.820
For some reason, I don't want
to get too personal with her.

00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:30.780
I don't know. Maybe I just don't have the courage.

00:16:30.780 --> 00:16:31.860
I don't know.

00:16:31.860 --> 00:16:34.490
You're so stupid, you stupid virgin!

00:16:34.490 --> 00:16:35.530
Ishino...

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:39.900
I don't know if you're acting
like a healthy boy or an unhealthy one.

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:42.780
Ah, to be disgraced by Tsutsui. Oh, the poor girl!

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:44.110
I know...

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:46.360
So stop whining to me and go to her!

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:47.200
Get laid!

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:49.320
I-Ishino, you are a lady!

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:51.650
Try and have some tact, woman!

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:54.820
So...

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:57.900
Where exactly are you hoping to go?

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:02.360
Actually, I figured you'd be having a hard time
with this, too, so I got some guidebooks-

00:17:02.360 --> 00:17:04.400
Uh, okay. That's good.

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:08.240
So... if you could just narrow down the places
you want to see, things you want to do...

00:17:08.530 --> 00:17:10.400
Yeah, I've already picked a few.

00:17:10.400 --> 00:17:13.610
But we'll have to come up
with different plans for different weather.

00:17:13.610 --> 00:17:17.490
A-and we'll have to look into methods
of transportation and make up an itinerary...

00:17:17.490 --> 00:17:21.740
Tsutsun! Why are you putting tabasco sauce
in your orange juice?

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:24.820
Once we've got it all figured out,
I'll make us some travel booklets before we go.

00:17:24.820 --> 00:17:27.240
Whoa, Tsutsun! Slow down.

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:31.070
You're making it too much of a chore!

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:35.320
We're planning a trip together.
Shouldn't we be more, I don't know, excited?

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:36.650
Uh, should we?

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:37.860
Yes, we should.

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:41.990
This isn't a class trip. So just relax, okay?

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:43.610
Okay.

00:17:48.990 --> 00:17:50.280
I'm sorry.

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:53.570
I've been pushing you too hard, haven't I?

00:17:54.570 --> 00:17:56.990
Maybe we should just call the trip off.

00:17:57.780 --> 00:17:59.070
N-no, it's okay, I...

00:17:59.070 --> 00:18:00.150
Tsutsun.

00:18:00.150 --> 00:18:02.610
You've looked stressed out since you got here.

00:18:02.950 --> 00:18:07.360
If you don't feel the same way about this trip
as I do, then there's no point in going.

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:10.320
I'm sorry.

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:12.360
I'll just go home now.

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:15.320
Wait!

00:18:24.650 --> 00:18:28.110
Ah, to be disgraced by Tsutsui. Oh, the poor girl!

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:31.240
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:34.320
But I'm just not ready for that kind of thing yet.

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:37.780
Kamakura

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:41.700
She marked a lot of pages.

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:46.400
I was so flustered, I didn't listen to a word she said.

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:46.900
Kamakura

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:51.200
She said she wanted to go on a trip
the last time we had a long weekend, too.

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:53.570
She must have been looking forward to it.

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:55.400
Kamakura

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:55.780
This is a foodie guide.

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:58.360
Kamakura

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:57.950
And that one's for sightseeing.

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:01.950
And what have I been thinking about all this time?

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:02.860
Am I stupid?!

00:19:02.860 --> 00:19:04.110
Kamakura

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:07.070
These are good!

00:19:07.070 --> 00:19:08.150
I know, right?

00:19:08.150 --> 00:19:10.030
If you need desserts, I'm your guy!

00:19:10.030 --> 00:19:13.740
Just so you know, I still don't really trust you.

00:19:13.740 --> 00:19:15.200
That's harsh...

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:20.110
I really do only come to these places
with my guy friends or my sister, I promise.

00:19:20.110 --> 00:19:24.570
What in the world happened to you
to make it so hard for you to trust people?

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:29.200
A day isn't long enough to tell my tale.
You still want to know?

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:31.320
Yup! I want to know it all.

00:19:31.320 --> 00:19:33.650
If it takes more than a day, I'll come back tomorrow.

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:36.900
And I know a ton more restaurants, too!

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:40.150
Whoa, that was close.

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:42.570
It's been too long since anyone's been this nice to me.

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:46.650
He's actually treating me
like a boy would treat a girl on a date.

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:49.740
Unlike Mr. Ramen Shop Takanashi.

00:19:50.150 --> 00:19:52.900
Hey, do you want to hang out over the long weekend?

00:19:55.450 --> 00:19:57.360
Okay. Sure.

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:04.860
I wonder what was going through her mind
when she asked me to go on a trip.

00:20:05.280 --> 00:20:08.490
I bet it took some courage for her
to make the suggestion.

00:20:08.490 --> 00:20:10.030
And I was totally oblivious.

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:12.490
I just kept thinking about how to get out of it.

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:15.990
Tsutsun...?

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:18.110
I looked at this.

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:20.200
I looked at every page you had marked.

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:24.150
It looks like fun.

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:26.530
So let's take this trip together.

00:20:29.400 --> 00:20:30.320
Yeah.

00:20:42.360 --> 00:20:47.820
Kareha no rhythm owari no kisetsu

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:51.900
Boku no te o hiiteta

00:20:53.070 --> 00:21:03.320
Shiroi toiki wa kiekaketeita mirai (mirai)

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:21.360
Kurikaeshi demo furidashi demo ii mujaki ni misete

00:21:22.530 --> 00:21:27.780
Aitai hito ni aeta ka na

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:33.030
Naritai hito ni nareta ka na

00:21:33.150 --> 00:21:43.700
Kimi ga kimi rashiku iru koto de boku ga boku rashiku ireta yo

00:21:43.820 --> 00:21:49.110
Tada iki o suru kyou to iu hi ga

00:21:49.110 --> 00:21:54.360
Nani yori subarashii koto sa

00:21:54.450 --> 00:21:59.650
Nanimo iranai saa ikou

00:21:59.780 --> 00:22:07.780
Shinpai nanka nanimo nai

00:22:11.990 --> 00:22:15.950
We could not find a hotel
that matches your search.

00:22:12.320 --> 00:22:13.860
I-I'm sorry!

00:22:13.860 --> 00:22:15.900
I should have made the reservation sooner.

00:22:16.320 --> 00:22:17.780
Oh, that's okay.

00:22:17.780 --> 00:22:21.650
Besides, I think I was being too pushy
and forcing my feelings onto you.

00:22:21.860 --> 00:22:22.950
Y-you weren't.

00:22:23.150 --> 00:22:25.150
I'll look for a place, too.

00:22:26.780 --> 00:22:27.700
Wait.

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:29.110
Look.

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:33.070
Notice
Due to their low test scores, the following students
require remedial classes:
Igarashi, Iroha               Yamanishi, Kazuhiro
Sudo, Kazuyuki                   Yoshida, Satoru

00:22:31.570 --> 00:22:33.070
Remedial classes?!

00:22:33.400 --> 00:22:35.570
And right over the three-day weekend.

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:37.700
B-but I can just skip those!

00:22:37.700 --> 00:22:40.650
No. We'll go on a trip next time.

00:22:42.530 --> 00:22:43.530
Okay.
